                "html": "<p>When you send a <strong>New starter request</strong>:</p><ol><li>IT sets up the laptop and accounts.</li><li>Facilities prepares the desk, badge and parking.</li><li>The People team sends the contract, sets up payroll and books the induction.</li><li>The manager plans the first week and names a buddy.</li></ol><p>Each task is due on the start date and ticks off its checklist item.</p>"
